{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:0.1", "PA_ja_158:0.2", "PA_ja_158:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Firm (Daḷhavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:0.4"], "en": "8. The Suhanu Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:1.1", "PA_ja_158:1.2"], "en": "\"This was not with Soṇa of uneven character, but together with Suhanu.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:1.3"], "en": "Suhanu was just like that,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:1.4"], "en": "one who shared Soṇa’s sphere of activity;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:2.1"], "en": "[he was struck] by the impudent Pakkhandin.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:2.2"], "en": "\"By one who constantly eats their own bonds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:2.3"], "en": "evil is equalized with evil,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:2.4"], "en": "and the non-existent is equalized with the non-existent.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_158:3.1"], "en": "The Suhañña Jātaka, the eighth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
